==Notes==
* The second and third word of this shout make it increasingly less efficient when it comes to damage per second (dps) per second of cooldown. The first word alone does 1.6 damage per second of cooldown, while the second word and third word only do 1.4 and 0.9 damage per second of cooldown, respectively.
* Like most fire spells, using this shout over an oil slick will ignite it, as well as igniting an area with explosive gas, causing a large explosion. It will also set off any runes (ones you've cast, or hostile runes).
* [[Skyrim:Alduin|Alduin]] can be seen using this shout at the beginning of the game, when half of the tower your character and [[Skyrim:Ralof|Ralof]] enter is blocked by rubble. If the subtitles are activated, he can be seen saying the last 2 words, ''"Toor...Shul!"''
** If the subtitles are activated when [[Skyrim:Hadvar|Hadvar]] tells you to stay close to the wall, Alduin can be seen using all 3 words.

==Bugs==
{{Bug|If none or only one of the words of the shout Fire Breath is known when you first approach [[Skyrim:Paarthurnax (dragon)|Paarthurnax]] at the [[Skyrim:Throat of the World|Throat of the World]], and you have a dragon soul in stock, you can use the soul to learn the newly found word on the wall before Paarthurnax unlocks it for you. This results in the "soul" from Paarthurnax teaching you the next word of the shout. This way you can learn two words of the shout at the same time.|confirmed=1}}
** If you do this when you have no words for Fire Breath, the next word wall for Fire Breath encountered will not unlock the final word. All three locations will still need to be visited to unlock the final word. If you have unlocked one word, you do not have to visit the final location; however, it will still run the animation as if you were learning the word.
{{Bug|Summoning [[Skyrim:Fire Wyrm|Fire Wyrms]]{{DB}} in the [[Skyrim:Soul Cairn|Soul Cairn]]{{DG}} via this shout with the [[Skyrim:Dragonborn Flame|Dragonborn Flame]]{{DB}} ability active can cause the Fire Wyrms to be hostile towards the lost souls there.|USLEEP|3.0.1|Both factions have been set as allies to each other.}}

